cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Comparison of FedAvg, FedProx, and FedTrimmedAvg for IoT Botnet Detection on N-BaIoT and CIC-IoT2023 under Non-IID Conditions"
abstract: >-
  A federated learning study comparing the FedAvg, FedProx, and FedTrimmedAvg
  aggregation strategies for IoT botnet detection on the N-BaIoT and
  CIC-IoT2023 datasets under non-IID (Dirichlet-partitioned) client
  distributions, with MLP and CNN classifiers, centralized baselines, and
  multi-seed mean +/- std reporting.
